{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555010/extras/ad920b94a760ec820ce7b4394f98ed61.poster.avif?t=1724777680\" width=502 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555010/extras/ad920b94a760ec820ce7b4394f98ed61.webm?t=1724777680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555010/extras/ad920b94a760ec820ce7b4394f98ed61.mp4?t=1724777680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Egor\u2019s head! </h2><br>He had lost himself even before his thirties. <br>But that was not enough for the fate and Egor got fired. <br><br>Such events could be the last straw for anybody. Our hero\u2019s ego shuttered into pieces <br>and now each piece sounds in its own way. <br><br>Or maybe it\u2019s not just ego\u2019s shards but childhood and adolescence traumas <br>found a will and a voice.<br><br>Anyway, the end of this story depends on you. <br>Will our hero find a new job? Will he get rid of the voices in his head? <br><br>Now and further you and only you make all the decisions! <br>Egor\u2019s fate is in your hands. But maybe\u2026 they made you think like that\u2026<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555010/extras/b637de6b2b127693214d7109f5e17adb.avif?t=1724777680\" width=184 height=184 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555010/extras/227812db0b40cb0f85a81f64f3ca4215.avif?t=1724777680\" width=130 height=160 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555010/extras/248895e39847b716d1bb262d30e0ab61.avif?t=1724777680\" widt